  <description>
    Photorealistic 3D model of Starbucks Coffee Nikko Store (星巴克新竹日光門市, 關新路 38 號).
    Features authentic 45-degree chamfered corner entrance, rectified real-photo PBR facade textures,
    ribbon glass windows, 2F Bagel 24H Tennis Studio awnings, outdoor wood-slat fenced terrace with planter boxes,
    and rooftop steel truss billboard framework with elevated green Siren medallion logo.
  </description>
